<div id="@_d.I.ClassName" style="display: contents">
    <main id="main"><section class="hero"><div class="hero-copy"><div class="hero-copy-inner"><p class="eyebrow">JUST BUDGET HOME LOANS</p><h1>Home loan support for where life takes you.</h1><p class="hero-lead">The right home loan conversation starts with understanding your circumstances. Explore your property and refinancing options with a team you already know.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-lime" href="/jbhl/contact">Talk to our team <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/jbhl#options">Explore your options ↓</a></div></div></div><div class="hero-image" role="img" aria-label="Contemporary Australian home surrounded by a native garden"><div class="image-note"><span class="note-mark">jb</span><span>More support for<br>your next chapter.</span></div></div></section>
    <section class="intro section" id="options"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR OPTIONS</p><h2>One familiar team. More ways forward.</h2></div><p>Whether you are changing your current loan, buying a property or weighing up equity, we can help you consider the details that matter to you.</p></div><div class="card-grid"><a class="service-card" href="/jbhl/refinance"><div class="card-number">01</div><h3>Refinance your home loan</h3><p>Explore a different rate, repayment structure or loan features with support from a familiar team.</p><span class="card-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="service-card" href="/jbhl/buy-a-home"><div class="card-number">02</div><h3>Buy a home</h3><p>Understand your borrowing options and what happens from your first conversation through to settlement.</p><span class="card-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="service-card" href="/jbhl/investment-property"><div class="card-number">03</div><h3>Investment property loans</h3><p>Explore lending for an investment property with a focus on structure, repayments and your wider financial position.</p><span class="card-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="service-card" href="/jbhl/second-mortgages"><div class="card-number">04</div><h3>Second mortgages</h3><p>A second mortgage may provide a way to access funds while keeping an existing home loan in place. We will help you weigh the costs and risks.</p><span class="card-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="service-card" href="/jbhl/property-debt-consolidation"><div class="card-number">05</div><h3>Property backed debt consolidation</h3><p>If you own property, consolidating debts into a home loan may change your repayments. Understand the total cost and security risk first.</p><span class="card-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
    <section class="feature"><div class="wrap feature-grid"><div class="feature-art"><span class="feature-rule"></span><p>For the home you have.<br><strong>And what comes next.</strong></p><span class="feature-small">JUST BUDGET HOME LOANS</span></div><div class="feature-copy"><p class="eyebrow">SUPPORT THAT FEELS FAMILIAR</p><h2>Your circumstances change. Your support can keep up.</h2><p>Just Budget Home Loans brings property lending conversations into the Just Budget family. We start by listening to what has changed, what you need now and what commitments feel manageable.</p><p>Then we help you make sense of the options and the trade-offs before you decide what to do.</p><a class="text-link dark" href="/jbhl/about">Get to know us <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
    <section class="section steps"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">HOW IT WORKS</p><h2>A clearer path, one step at a time.</h2></div></div><div class="steps-grid"><div><span>01 / START</span><h3>Tell us your goal</h3><p>Refinancing, buying or using property equity? Let us know what you are trying to achieve.</p></div><div><span>02 / REVIEW</span><h3>Look at the full picture</h3><p>We consider your existing commitments, the loan features that matter and the potential costs and risks.</p></div><div><span>03 / DECIDE</span><h3>Choose your next step</h3><p>We explain what is involved so you can decide whether to proceed with an application.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="cta-band"><div class="wrap cta-inner"><div><p class="eyebrow">A conversation can be a good start</p><h2>Let’s talk about your next step</h2><p>Tell us what you are hoping to do. Our team can help you understand the next step.</p></div><div class="cta-actions"><a class="button button-lime" href="/jbhl/contact">Get in touch <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="tel:1300795775" class="text-link light">Or call 1300 795 775</a></div></div></section></main>
</div>
